	(text_box "These circuit diagrams were drawn with AI assistance and have NOT been reviewed by a qualified high-voltage or\nmedical-device engineer. They may contain errors that would make a built circuit dangerous or useless. The storage\ncapacitor holds about 190 J at about 2,000 V, far above the level that stops a heart, and keeps it after the power is off.\nNobody builds, powers or probes anything from these files until a qualified engineer has reviewed them, the project's lab\nsafety policy exists, and a patent attorney has looked at freedom to operate (SAFETY.md section 2a, DECISIONS.md D-10,\nD-13, D-18). Nothing here is safe or ready for use on a person or animal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 31.75 0)
		(size 140 14.954)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -1)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
